OL,3,AWhat to know about Brazil's election
OL,4,Apitting Lula against Flavio Bolsonaro
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrazilians have begun voting in a
OL,7,Fgeneral election in which the two
OL,8,Ffront-runners for the presidency bear
OL,9,Fvery familiar names.
OL,11,FThe incumbent, veteran left-wing leader
OL,12,FLuiz Inacio Lula da Silva, will be
OL,13,Fchallenged by 11 candidates, the most
OL,14,Fprominent of whom is right-winger
OL,15,FFlavio Bolsonaro.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
