OL,3,AWhat to know about Brazil's election
OL,4,Apitting Lula against Flavio Bolsonaro
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the last election four years ago,
OL,7,FLula narrowly defeated Flavio
OL,8,FBolsonaro's father Jair, but the
OL,9,Ftumultuous aftermath of the election,
OL,10,Fwhich saw Jair Bolsonaro convicted of
OL,11,Fplotting a coup after thousands of his
OL,12,Fsupporters stormed the Brazilian
OL,13,FCongress, has had a lasting impact on
OL,14,Fthe nation's political life and this
OL,15,Felection.
OL,17,FHere's what you need to know.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
